{"version":1,"content":"<p>受內存價格持續上漲影響，今年手機市場出現了一個值得關注的現象，不僅部分新機價格上漲，就連二手手機也變得更加保值，部分熱門機型甚至出現價格反彈。據央視財經報道，近日，<strong>廣東深圳華強北二手手機市場交易持續升温，99新以及僅拆封的二手手機成為市場上的搶手貨。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584294.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T07:02:22.842486+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T06:48:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T06:58:55.750399+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T06:58:55.750399+00:00","content_hash":"31ddd47b72c0397f7182e079fcc79936c503334de117fcd52cb63733c5889b37","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}